 "statement": "The optional bounded-projective evaluator has 24 matched small pipeline replays covering 504 point-input evaluations across three supplied prime fields, with unchanged default and affine outputs, direct PARI quotient/image comparisons, 3717 small group-law comparisons and five option rejections. A separately bounded 202-bit target-field primitive check compares 32768 kernel-walk x-coordinates; it constructs no target quotient or isogeny images. Counters cover walk-local operations, not runtime or total work; no speedup or conductor crossing is established."
